  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\r\n\r\nIn the ServiceWorker static routing API (https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/pull/1701), the match algorithm is used for matching with a request URL, which is a [URL](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url).  However, the specification expects either of `USVString` or `URLPatternInit` as its input now.\r\n\r\nTo fill the gap, we may need to make the [match](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#urlpattern-match) algorithm accept URL.",
